==Strategy==
The usage of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] is very important against Doge Dark and Shadow Boxer K, while more expensive ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] can be used to damage a large amount of enemies at once.

350+ ranged attackers are the key to beating this stage because of the 340 range of H. Nah.

